The '''Zealot Bruiser Hideout''' is a sub-location of {{Zone|The End}}. 

{{ZoneText|Fight powerful Zealot Bruisers.}}

== Features ==
The '''Zealot Bruiser Hideout''' features {{MobSprite|Zealot Bruiser;Zealot Bruisers}}, stronger version of {{MobSprite|Zealot;Zealots}} with higher health and damage. {{MobSprite|Zealot Bruiser;Zealot Bruisers}} have a higher odds of spawning a [[Special Zealot]] than the ones on the Dragon's Nest.

=== Portal ===
There are two portals located in the [[Void Slate]], that both warp the player to the same location in the '''Zealot Bruiser Hideout'''. The player must have {{skl|combat|XX}} in order to use the portals and access the zone.

